OL,3,GNEWSAAstley Hall fully reopens after
OL,4,A#400k restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic house in Lancashire has
OL,7,Ffully reopened following a #400,000
OL,8,Frestoration.
OL,10,FAstley Hall, a Grade I-listed building
OL,11,Fin Chorley, welcomed visitors back into
OL,12,Fpreviously closed rooms after the final
OL,13,Fphase of a six-year restoration
OL,14,Fprogramme.
OL,16,FThe work has allowed historic furniture
OL,17,Fand artwork to be back on display,
OL,18,Fwhile bedrooms have been furnished to
OL,19,Freflect life at the hall more than 170
OL,20,Fyears ago.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
